<title>GREECE: Greek WPI slips to 2.5 pct yr/yr in April.</title>
<headline>Greek WPI slips to 2.5 pct yr/yr in April.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek wholesale price inflation eased to 2.5 percent year-on-year in April from 2.6 percent in March, the National Statistics Service (NSS) said in a statement.</p>
<p> Wholesale Price Index   April 97   March 97    April 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month (pct)	 0.8	   0.0	    0.9</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)	   2.5	   2.6	    7.0</p>
<p> Index (1980=100)	   884.6	 877.3	  863.4</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
